  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing PCA with scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal singleprofile setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5362 and F1 of 0.5158, slightly higher than the baseline PCA-based configuration. The results suggest the RNA encoder choice may influence performance, but the impact of fusion strategies or other architectural variations remains uncertain without direct comparison."
